# Shell scripts keep LF line endings in every checkout. On the windows-latest
# runner (ipcam-windows.yml), Git for Windows has core.autocrlf=true and would
# check them out with CRLF; Git Bash then fails on the carriage returns, e.g.
# in "#!/usr/bin/env bash" and "set -euo pipefail" of tools/scripts/annotate.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
